  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da42f0afd618fb4e",
      "translationZh": "距离 DeepSeek R1 发布已经过去两周，而我们启动 open-r1 项目以复现其中缺失的部分，也就是训练流水线和合成数据，才刚刚过去一周。本文总结了以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d949d667cf6a8f86",
      "translationZh": "Open-R1 在复现 DeepSeek-R1 流水线和数据集方面的进展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf2632ffdae2cabf",
      "translationZh": "我们对 DeepSeek-R1 的新认识，以及围绕它展开的讨论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c2567f020fcfcbb",
      "translationZh": "自 DeepSeek-R1 发布以来，社区构建的精彩项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fce4738dbee61504",
      "translationZh": "本文既是项目进展的更新，也汇集了与 DeepSeek-R1 相关的有趣资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "25423510bae6dce6",
      "translationZh": "1 周后的进展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50fada5eac3d78b3",
      "translationZh": "首先来看看我们在 Open-R1 上取得的进展。我们在一周前才启动 Open-R1，各个团队以及社区的成员便齐心协力投入其中，现在已经有了一些进展可以向大家汇报。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97e5dde8492b5a0b",
      "translationZh": "复现的第一步是验证我们能否达到一致的评估分数。我们能够在 MATH-500 基准测试上复现 Deepseek 报告的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bc686a1025c0fab",
      "translationZh": "MATH-500（DeepSeek 报告值）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96a6cd01b26a4903",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 open-r1 仓库中找到运行这些评估的说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1744ece4e84d95aa",
      "translationZh": "我们观察到，DeepSeek 模型生成的内容篇幅极长，这使得即使只是评估模型也颇具挑战。这里展示了 DeepSeek-R1 在 OpenThoughts 数据集中的回复长度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1484e6cc1c60699f",
      "translationZh": "R1 的回复长度分布显示，其回复总体上非常长，平均每条回复长达 6,000 个词元，有些回复甚至超过 20,000 个词元。值得注意的是，平均每页约有 500 个单词，而一个词元平均略少于一个单词，这意味着许多回复的篇幅超过了 10 页。（来源：https://x.com/gui_penedo/status/1884953463051649052）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2c94b5c9e7e0bdd",
      "translationZh": "回复的长度将使 GPRO 训练面临挑战，因为我们必须生成很长的补全文本，这将需要占用相当大比例的 GPU 显存，以存储优化步骤所需的激活值 / 梯度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4705a721578167e3",
      "translationZh": "为了公开分享我们的进展，我们创建了一个 open-r1 评估排行榜，让社区能够跟进我们的复现工作（Space 在这里）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7280a01cfec1cb4d",
      "translationZh": "训练流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd921a862d7908ab",
      "translationZh": "Open R1 发布后，GRPO（分组相对策略优化）被集成到最新的 TRL 版本（0.14 版）中。这一集成支持使用一个或多个奖励函数或奖励模型来训练任意模型。GRPO 的实现集成了 DeepSpeed ZeRO 1/2/3，可进行扩展到大量 GPU 的并行训练，并使用 vLLM 来加速生成，而生成正是在线训练方法的主要瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acab4840bf684763",
      "translationZh": "目前仍存在一些与内存占用过高有关的局限，针对这些问题的性能剖析和内存占用优化工作正在推进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f0e537d058a4d67",
      "translationZh": "合成数据生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0a7aa414b300969",
      "translationZh": "R1 报告中最令人振奋的发现之一是，可以使用主模型生成合成推理轨迹，而在这一数据集上微调的较小模型，也能获得与主模型相近的性能提升。因此，我们自然也希望重新构建这一合成推理数据集，让社区能够用它来微调其他模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba962b19ced7def8",
      "translationZh": "对于 R1 这样庞大的模型，主要挑战在于如何高效、快速地扩大生成规模。我们花了一周时间，反复尝试各种部署方案和配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "300f49b743763579",
      "translationZh": "该模型可以装入两个 8xH100 节点，因此我们自然先从这一配置开始实验，并使用 vLLM 作为推理服务器。然而，我们很快就发现，这种配置并不理想：吞吐量不够好，而且由于 GPU KV 缓存填满得太快，只能支持 8 个并行请求。当缓存填满时，占用大量缓存的请求会被抢占；如果配置使用 PreemptionMode.RECOMPUTE，这些请求就会在之后有更多可用显存时重新调度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf723d5faf98c444",
      "translationZh": "随后，我们改用 4 个 8xH100 节点的配置，总计 32 个 GPU。这样就能留出足够的空闲显存，让 32 个请求并行运行，而且几乎不会有请求因缓存利用率达到 100% 而被重新调度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ecad32808226085",
      "translationZh": "最初，我们以成批请求的方式查询 vLLM 服务器，但很快发现，批次中处理较慢的请求会导致 GPU 利用率波动，因为只有上一批次的最后一个样本处理完毕后，新批次才会开始处理。将批量推理改为流式处理后，GPU 利用率的稳定性显著改善：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baa69b9914ad53c9",
      "translationZh": "这只需要修改向 vLLM 服务器发送请求的代码。批量推理的代码如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62d9655c1807b821",
      "translationZh": "用于流式请求的新代码如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a74cff6a7f0663ff",
      "translationZh": "我们的生成速率相当稳定，但可能仍会进一步探索，例如，当长查询被抢占时，切换到 CPU 缓存是否是更好的策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5154bb8339581d5",
      "translationZh": "当前的推理代码可以在这里找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5803fdf10e57e66",
      "translationZh": "对外传播",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f82ff26804f887d",
      "translationZh": "open-r1 引起了广泛关注，媒体也不例外，因此过去一周里，多位团队成员登上了新闻：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71c36530abe60d08",
      "translationZh": "Lewis 参加了 CNN 的直播（！）：https://x.com/_lewtun/status/1884377909038833894?s=46",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f29e43d3f8194d3",
      "translationZh": "Thom 亮相 Bloomberg：https://x.com/Thom_Wolf/status/1884353433865777520",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95b130565d195044",
      "translationZh": "Leandro 做客 NPR 的 Money Planet 节目（约在第 21 分钟）：https://www.npr.org/2024/11/29/1215793948/deepseek-ai-china-us-semiconductors-stock-nvidia",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ca14f6685707f9d",
      "translationZh": "其他提及此事的媒体：《华盛顿邮报》、《金融时报》、《金融时报》、《财富》、《财富》、The Verge、《金融评论》、Tech Crunch、《时代周报》、《金融时报》、《纽约时报》、《华尔街日报》、EuroNews、《巴伦周刊》、《纽约时报》、Vox、《自然》、SwissInfo、《商报》、Business Insider、IEEE Spectrum、MIT Tech Review、《世界报》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be530ae7a5672718",
      "translationZh": "关于 DeepSeek-R1，我们了解到了什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f337fd24f382c613",
      "translationZh": "社区仍在消化 DeepSeek-R1 的结果和报告，而在发布仅两周后，DeepSeek 就已引起更广泛的公众关注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e29a72a4651eb7b",
      "translationZh": "对 R1 的反应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "255b9f37d3687bac",
      "translationZh": "发布后的第一周相对平静，第二周市场则出现了显著反应，促使多家 AI 研究实验室作出回应：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2489eb9749fc2fce",
      "translationZh": "股市在周一遭受冲击，但在随后的几天里企稳或回升：https://x.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1883831022149927352",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a34154d134f29ad",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 首席执行官 Sam Altman 向 DeepSeek 表示祝贺，并宣布他们将提前发布一些新东西，很快就会推出：https://x.com/sama/status/1884066337103962416",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78a2ae9f1770ca74",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 首席研究官 Mark Chen 就 DeepSeek 如何发现与 OpenAI 用于 o1 的理念相似的理念发表了评论：https://x.com/markchen90/status/1884303237186216272",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "736a370f39c2a133",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 首席执行官 Dario Amodei 借此机会进一步强调出口管制，描绘了一个两极或单极世界的图景：https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/1884636410839535967",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea33edc996d95587",
      "translationZh": "与此同时，多家公司着手通过各种平台提供 DeepSeek 模型（以下列表并不完整）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad78e0f1f7b0b3f8",
      "translationZh": "Dell：Dell 首席执行官兼创始人 Michael Dell 宣布，与 Hugging Face 合作推出用于运行 DeepSeek-R1 的本地部署解决方案：https://x.com/MichaelDell/status/1884677233014398994",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1c00066e8a84fab",
      "translationZh": "AWS：Amazon 首席执行官 Andy Jassy 宣布，DeepSeek-R1 现已在 Amazon BedRock 和 SageMaker 上提供：https://x.com/ajassy/status/1885120938813120549",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "65f73ffc47c71325",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek V3 训练算力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a53c2a2be82bb3d",
      "translationZh": "人们对公布的 V3/R1 训练成本表现出了浓厚兴趣。虽然确切数字可能没那么重要，但一些人做了粗略估算，以核实这里的数量级。简而言之，这些数字的数量级总体上似乎是合理的，相关讨论如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9b3ceaa191e7350",
      "translationZh": "马里兰大学教授 Tom Goldstein：https://x.com/tomgoldsteincs/status/1884651376854122774",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce49aa5a7062ffbf",
      "translationZh": "MatX 创始人 Reiner Pope 对比了 Llama3 与 DeepSeek V3：https://x.com/reinerpope/status/1884056274893168896",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26fe9ab32a411181",
      "translationZh": "现就职于 OpenAI、曾在 Google Brain/DeepMind 工作的 Lukas Beyer，讨论了 MFU 的起源：https://x.com/giffmana/status/1884160434846224688",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18cce52c5ab9ff21",
      "translationZh": "SemiAnalysis 发布了一份报告，推测 DeepSeek 可用的基础设施：https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/1885192148037112023",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc38662ad475adf0",
      "translationZh": "随着许多团队着手复现训练流程，我们将获得更多证据，了解该模型可能达到的训练效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4d029cbbbac50799",
      "translationZh": "训练数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfe96039b679530c",
      "translationZh": "上周出现了一些猜测，认为 DeepSeek 可能一直在使用 OpenAI 的输出来训练自己的模型。例如，可参见《金融时报》的报道。不过，目前尚不清楚这些指控会带来什么后果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb501d7877eb7ddb",
      "translationZh": "社区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6af7e8d8c36ed9b1",
      "translationZh": "开源社区围绕 DeepSeek-R1 的活动极为活跃，许多人开始基于该模型构建有趣的项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04e2a9728af75840",
      "translationZh": "项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5bfa65679ec67ff",
      "translationZh": "已经有不少项目尝试在较小规模上复现其基本学习机制，让你可以在家测试这些基本学习原理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "286ee5791bf9735d",
      "translationZh": "Will Brown 展示了如何使用 TRL 中的 GRPO Trainer，通过 Llama 1B 复现一条最简训练曲线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35702a0f0c41e288",
      "translationZh": "TinyZero 表明，只需花费 <30$ 并使用一个 3B 基础模型，你就能亲身体验那个“啊哈”时刻！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b75b53646524554",
      "translationZh": "Philipp Schmid 也发布了一篇关于 Mini-R1 的教程，同样展示了如何复现“啊哈”时刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a06d3af2494aa5f",
      "translationZh": "在更大的模型规模上，香港科技大学的研究人员发布了一篇博文，展示了一个 7B 数学模型中推理能力的涌现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31d3ccae5b99c8ba",
      "translationZh": "Evolving LLM 实验室的研究人员已开始开发 R1 的多模态版本：https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/open-r1-multimodal",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "935d750ce4d99426",
      "translationZh": "Stepanov 已开始尝试使用 R1 从文本中提取图结构：https://huggingface.co/blog/Ihor/replicating-deepseek-r1-for-information-extraction",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf7d3888bf2f2c83",
      "translationZh": "TinyZero 的结果显示，模型的推理过程在不断扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410fce128ea5acd5",
      "translationZh": "同样，香港科技大学研究人员提供的这张图展示了随着训练的继续，模型如何生成越来越长的推理轨迹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e9faf7b714ee2400",
      "translationZh": "数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a43a6efb50ddb866",
      "translationZh": "社区一直在推进多项与 R1 相关的数据集工作，其中一些亮点包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1594eb9e4eabfa20",
      "translationZh": "bespokelabs/Bespoke-Stratos-17k：复现了 Berkeley Sky-T1 的数据流水线，该流水线使用 DeepSeek-R1 创建包含问题、推理轨迹和答案的数据集。随后，这些数据被用于采用与 R1 论文类似的蒸馏方法，对 7B 和 32B 的 Qwen 模型进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17663be35d3fd5a2",
      "translationZh": "open-thoughts/OpenThoughts-114k：一个“开放的合成推理数据集，包含 114k 个高质量样例，涵盖数学、科学、代码和谜题”。它是 Open Thoughts 工作的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ed26de8c8f3a6fe",
      "translationZh": "cognitivecomputations/dolphin-r1：一个包含 800k 个样本的数据集，其中包含 DeepSeek-R1、Gemini flash 生成的补全内容，以及来自 Dolphin chat 的 200k 个样本，旨在帮助训练 R1 风格的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fb482fab2765372",
      "translationZh": "ServiceNow-AI/R1-Distill-SFT：目前包含 17,000 个样本，是 ServiceNow Language Models 实验室为支持 Open-R1 工作而创建数据的一项工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d108cfb3150f3fd",
      "translationZh": "NovaSky-AI/Sky-T1_data_17k：用于训练 Sky-T1-32B-Preview 的数据集。该数据集属于一项较早期的复现 o1 风格推理的工作。使用该数据集训练模型的成本不到 $450。这篇博文介绍了更多细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60ca975408a600dd",
      "translationZh": "Magpie-Align/Magpie-Reasoning-V2-250K-CoT-Deepseek-R1-Llama-70B：该数据集扩展了 Magpie 及其无需起始提示即可生成指令数据的方法，使回答中包含推理。指令由 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct 和 Llama 3.3 70B Instruct 生成，回答则由 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B 生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "221cf232796dc61b",
      "translationZh": "这份列表仅涵盖了 Hub 上与推理和问题求解相关的一小部分数据集。我们很期待看到社区在未来几周构建出哪些其他数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ff1257d106c90a9",
      "translationZh": "接下来呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a213dbdf1fc2d66",
      "translationZh": "我们才刚刚起步，希望完成训练流水线，在更小的模型上进行尝试，并使用扩展后的推理流水线生成高质量数据集。如果你想参与贡献，请查看 GitHub 上的 open-r1 仓库，或关注 Hugging Face 上的 open-r1 组织。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
